[00:07.14]I hate to sleep with one eye open
[00:07.14]我讨厌无法熟睡的日子
[00:13.04]I see the headlights turn to shadows driving past
[00:13.04]看见车灯驶过，变成阴影重重
[00:18.97]I hope one night it’s not you going
[00:18.97]我希望那晚离去的不是你
